  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "_comment": "Daily 06:15 and on the app's 'ซิงค์ราคาตอนนี้' button (SYNC_WEBHOOK_URL = this webhook's production URL; header auth = the RFQ integration token). Reads COST UPDATE 2021 for import '2021'!A3:AQ, SMG PRICELIST NATIONWIDE 'Pricelist update'!A2:I and the newest 'SMG MASTER <period>' file (MASTER!A1:R, HOTPRICE!A1:G), then posts them to /api/integrations/import/smg_catalog?priceList=<period>. The app checks every header row, refuses an unknown period (create it first in ตั้งค่า → รอบราคา) and replaces that period's EVE/Evercook/Excel products in one transaction. Replace PUT_*_FILE_ID_HERE, rfq.example.com and the credentials."
}
